WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:11.400
One app that needs to meet its market? Every week, on top of building it. See Traction in action on one of our apps, from its sign-up to its market.

00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:15.100
It reads your app like a new customer.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:19.680
Three fields and a passkey. Nothing to install or connect.

00:00:19.680 --> 00:00:26.640
Your board opens, and your Growth Manager starts reading your app.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:31.240
Your first read: what works, what’s in the way, and the move to make first.

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:35.940
Each finding quotes your own pages, so you can check it.

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:40.240
The first move uses words your site already has.

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:43.970
Then your Growth Manager proposes the next step. You choose.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:47.070
It finds people your app could help.

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:51.250
One click starts the research: five prospects who may need your app.

00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:56.710
It reads the web for businesses whose own pages show the need.

00:00:56.710 --> 00:01:04.690
Five found. A public page suggests a fit; only a reply confirms interest.

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:09.980
Each with the line from its own site that shows the fit.

00:01:09.980 --> 00:01:13.480
It writes to each, in your voice.

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:20.820
A first email for each, in your voice and signed with your name.

00:01:20.820 --> 00:01:24.640
You read it. You decide.

00:01:24.640 --> 00:01:29.750
Approve, and all five go to your CRM with their drafts. Nothing is sent without you.

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:33.250
Ask in a sentence. Get a plan.

00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:39.830
Want more? Tell your Growth Manager in one sentence, with a date.

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:46.040
It comes back with a plan to your date, and waits for your yes.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:50.140
Then it follows your app every day. Tell it what happened, and it works out what comes next.

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:53.440
It keeps up with your market.

00:01:53.440 --> 00:01:57.040
Your market, one read a day. Here, on Traction’s own board.

00:01:57.040 --> 00:02:04.930
One tile a day since its market read began. Pick a day to see what moved.

00:02:04.930 --> 00:02:09.730
Each story with its source and the words it quotes, so you can check it.

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:14.540
And what changed since yesterday, before you choose the next move.

00:02:14.540 --> 00:02:27.040
Make Traction work for you, now.
